			"contents": "# CyberSheppard Official Plugins\n\nOfficial plugin repository for [CyberSheppard](https://github.com/Dognet-Technologies/cybersheppard) MicroSIEM platform.\n\n[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue.svg)](LICENSE)\n[![Plugins](https://img.shields.io/badge/plugins-12-green.svg)](plugins/)\n[![CI Status](https://github.com/Dognet-Technologies/plugins-official/workflows/CI/badge.svg)](https://github.com/Dognet-Technologies/plugins-official/actions)\n\n## 🚀 Available Plugins\n\n### Vulnerability Scanners\n- **[Nexpose Scanner](plugins/vulnerability-scanner-nexpose/)** - Rapid7 Nexpose integration\n- **[Qualys Scanner](plugins/vulnerability-scanner-qualys/)** - Qualys VMDR integration\n- **[Nessus Scanner](plugins/vulnerability-scanner-nessus/)** - Tenable Nessus integration\n- **[OpenVAS Scanner](plugins/vulnerability-scanner-openvas/)** - Open-source scanner integration\n\n### Integrations\n- **[Ansible Integration](plugins/integration-ansible/)** - Automated remediation with Ansible\n- **[Chef Integration](plugins/integration-chef/)** - Infrastructure as Code with Chef\n\n### Enrichment\n- **[Reporting Enricher](plugins/enrichment-reporting/)** - Advanced reporting capabilities\n- **[Remediation Planner](plugins/enrichment-remediation/)** - Automated remediation plans\n\n### Customization\n- **[Theme Pack - Professional Dark](plugins/theme-pack-professional-dark/)** - Dark theme collection\n- **[Language Pack - Italian](plugins/language-pack-italian/)** - Italian localization\n- **[Language Pack - Spanish](plugins/language-pack-spanish/)** - Spanish localization\n\n## 📦 Installation\n\n### From CyberSheppard UI\n\n1. Open CyberSheppard web interface\n2. Navigate to **Plugins** → **Plugin Manager**\n3. The official repository is pre-configured\n4. Browse available plugins and click **Install**\n\n### Manual Installation\n\n```bash\n# Clone the repository\ngit clone https://github.com/Dognet-Technologies/plugins-official.git\n\n# Copy plugin to CyberSheppard plugins directory\ncp -r plugins-official/plugins/plugin-name /var/cybersheppard/plugins/\n\n# Enable via UI or API\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/plugins/install/{plugin_id}\n```\n### 🛠️ Plugin Development\n\n## Quick Start\n```\n# Clone the repository\ngit clone https://github.com/Dognet-Technologies/plugins-official.git\ncd plugins-official\n\n# Copy example plugin as template\ncp -r plugins/example-plugin plugins/my-new-plugin\ncd plugins/my-new-plugin\n\n# Edit manifest.json\nvim manifest.json\n\n# Plugin Structure\nplugins/my-plugin/\n├── manifest.json          # Plugin metadata (REQUIRED)\n├── plugin.py             # Main plugin code (for Python)\n├── requirements.txt      # Dependencies (Python)\n├── README.md             # Documentation\n├── LICENSE               # Plugin license\n└── tests/                # Unit tests\n    └── test_plugin.py\n\n\n# Manifest Example\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-plugin\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"stato\": \"stable\",\n  \"stability_level\": \"beta\",\n  \"owner\": \"cybersheppard-official\",\n  \"description\": \"Plugin description\",\n  \"language\": \"python\",\n  \"runtime\": \"python3.11\",\n  \"quality\": \"ottima\",\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"compatibility\": {\n    \"min_version\": \"1.0.0\",\n    \"max_version\": \"2.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"permissions\": [\n    \"events:vulnerability:read\",\n    \"network:external\"\n  ],\n  \"resources\": {\n    \"max_memory_mb\": 128,\n    \"max_cpu_percent\": 5,\n    \"max_execution_time_ms\": 10000\n  },\n  \"events\": {\n    \"subscribes\": [\"vulnerability.detected\"],\n    \"publishes\": [\"my-plugin.event\"]\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"python\": [\"requests>=2.28.0\"]\n  },\n  \"configuration_schema\": {\n    \"api_url\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"required\": true,\n      \"label\": \"API URL\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"files\": {\n    \"main\": \"plugin.py\",\n    \"checksum\": \"sha256:abc123...\"\n  }\n}\n\n",
